# Boss EXP in a scripted boss fight (Gronk, Cathedral of Althena boss, battle id 5). Run with --save.
# The Cathedral's script (015) starts Gronk's fight with script op 0x10 type 3, battle id 5 (0x43A8).
# Like boss_sasquatch.plan, this plan stands Jian in Delrich Temple (map 6) and does the field loop's
# three writes itself (0x020B7838 = 1, 0x020B783A = battle id, 0x020B0010 = 0x73). Gronk has no area_min
# override, so the fight keeps map 6's area_min (4) and at party level 1 Gronk rolls level 4 here.
# Expected (docs/boss-exp.md): row 142, EXP 148 at level 0 and 10424 at level 98: 148 + 10276 * 4 / 98 = 567.
# (In the Cathedral itself the fight rolls level 10 or more: 1196.)
# Gronk takes about eight of Jian's actions; 40 A presses, then a shot and an A every 120 frames
# (the kill lands inside that loop) walk the rest of the fight and the result pages.
watch u16 0x020B85BE event_battle_id
watch u16 0x020B85C0 battle_mode
watch u16 0x020B85C8 result_sub
watch u32 0x020B8610 exp_pool
watch u32 0x020B4824 silver
watch u32 0x020B4694 jian_exp32
watch u32 0x020B4664 jian_level
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
# warp6 without the final move onto an enemy spawn point
pin u16 0x020B77EC 6
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 30
shot gronk_field
peek u32 0x020B4694 jian_exp_before
peek u32 0x020B4664 jian_level_before
peek u32 0x020B4824 silver_before
poke u16 0x020B7838 1
poke u16 0x020B783A 5
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x73
wait 240
shot gronk_intro
battlers
peek u32 0x020B85B8 area_group
peek u16 0x020B85BC map
peek u32 0x020B8620 stats_ptr
# battle stat records 0..13 (0x6C each): +0x0C level, +0x14 HP, +0x50 EXP the kill adds
dump 0x0228E860 0x5E8 stat_records
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 40
shot gronk_a5
battlers
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 40
press A 3
wait 40
